# =====================================================================
# NO MAN'S SKY: ATLAS TERMINAL - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# =====================================================================
# Copy this file to .env and insert your Gemini API key if running locally.
#
# HOW TO ACQUIRE A FREE GEMINI API KEY:
# 1. Visit Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/
# 2. Click "Get API key" and create a free tier key.
# 3. Paste the key below replacing MY_GEMINI_API_KEY.
# =====================================================================

# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for live Gemini AI generation in Node full-stack mode.
# In local development or full-stack deployments (server.ts):
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# APP_URL: Optional base URL for this applet.
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"

# =====================================================================
# IMPORTANT NOTE FOR GITHUB PAGES DEPLOYMENT:
# =====================================================================
# GitHub Pages hosts static files (HTML, JS, CSS) with NO Node.js backend.
# Because of this:
# 1. GitHub Pages does NOT read this .env file.
# 2. The app includes a built-in "0-TOKEN / PROCEDURAL" mode that works 
#    100% offline without any API key or server!
# 3. If you or your users want live AI generation on GitHub Pages:
#    Simply tap the [CONFIG / KEY] button in the terminal on your phone
#    or browser, and paste your API key directly into the client settings.
#    It is stored securely and privately in your browser's localStorage.
# =====================================================================
